## Keycloak.Admin.Sdk.FeatureManagement

Keycloak.Admin.Sdk 的托管功能开关扩展，基于 Microsoft.FeatureManagement 4.8.0。先执行版本能力策略，再检查宿主总开关和目标功能开关，用于最终灰度开放和关闭。

### 安装

```shell
dotnet add package Keycloak.Admin.Sdk.FeatureManagement
```

安装本包会自动引用主包。Native AOT 应用使用主包的能力策略及 `KeycloakFeatureSnapshotGate`。

### 使用示例

以下示例使用内存配置演示组织功能的开放与关闭。先设置 `KEYCLOAK_ACCESS_TOKEN`，再替换服务器地址和 realm；服务器须匹配目标版本及默认 FGAP v2 路线、启用组织功能，令牌须具备相应管理权限。

```csharp
using Keycloak.Admin.Sdk;
using Keycloak.Admin.Sdk.Capabilities;
using Keycloak.Admin.Sdk.FeatureManagement;
using Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration;
using Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;
using Microsoft.FeatureManagement;

var configuration = new ConfigurationBuilder().AddInMemoryCollection(
    new Dictionary<string, string?>
    {
        ["feature_management:feature_flags:0:id"] = "KeycloakSdk.AdminApi",
        ["feature_management:feature_flags:0:enabled"] = "true",
        ["feature_management:feature_flags:1:id"] = "KeycloakSdk.Organizations",
        ["feature_management:feature_flags:1:enabled"] = "true"
    }).Build();
using var configurationLifetime = (IDisposable)configuration;
var services = new ServiceCollection();
services.AddSingleton<IConfiguration>(configuration);
services.AddFeatureManagement();
using var provider = services.BuildServiceProvider();

using var cancellation = new CancellationTokenSource(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(30));
var ct = cancellation.Token;
var server = new Uri("https://keycloak.example.com/");
using var http = new HttpClient(new SocketsHttpHandler { AllowAutoRedirect = false });
var tokens = new StaticAccessTokenProvider(
    Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable("KEYCLOAK_ACCESS_TOKEN")
    ?? throw new InvalidOperationException("请设置 KEYCLOAK_ACCESS_TOKEN"));
var support = new KeycloakSupportConfiguration(
    KeycloakTarget.Version, KeycloakRuntimeProfile.Managed);
IKeycloakAdminClient sdk = await KeycloakFeatureManagedClient.CreateAsync(
    http, server, tokens, support,
    provider.GetRequiredService<IVariantFeatureManager>(), cancellationToken: ct);

var organizations = await sdk.Organizations.SearchAsync(
    "target-realm", max: 20, cancellationToken: ct);
Console.WriteLine(organizations.Body?.Count ?? 0);

// 关闭组织功能，后续调用在业务 HTTP 请求发送前被拒绝。
configuration["feature_management:feature_flags:1:enabled"] = "false";
configuration.Reload();
try
{
    await sdk.Organizations.SearchAsync("target-realm", cancellationToken: ct);
}
catch (KeycloakCapabilityDeniedException error) when (
    error.Decision.Reason == KeycloakCapabilityReason.DisabledByHost)
{
    Console.WriteLine("组织功能已关闭");
}
```

### 开放规则

- `KeycloakSdk.AdminApi` 总开关与目标功能的 `FeatureId` 开关必须同时允许；缺失或关闭均拒绝。
- 工厂初始化先读取一次受认证的 `serverinfo`，再检查能力与总开关。配置变化影响后续逻辑请求，不撤销已发送请求。
- 宿主管理配置提供方、过滤器、灰度范围和刷新机制；支持策略也可通过 `KeycloakSupportConfiguration.Parse` 读取 JSON。
- 非 Stable 功能先完成独立业务验证和按环境晋升，再通过 schema 2 的 `previewCapabilities` 或 `experimentalCapabilities` 逐功能许可，最后由宿主开关控制开放。开关不会替代验证或修改上游阶段。

### 可选遥测

Application Insights 功能评估遥测默认关闭。启用时引入 `Keycloak.Admin.Sdk.FeatureManagement.ApplicationInsights` 命名空间，调用 `services.AddFeatureManagement().AddKeycloakApplicationInsightsTelemetry(enabled: true)`，为目标开关设置 `telemetry.enabled=true`，并由宿主注册 `TelemetryClient`、管理遥测生命周期及所注册 hosted services 的启动和停止。

